<title>UK: Cie Bancaire sets 2.0 bln FRF 12-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire sets 2.0 bln FRF 12-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by joint lead managers CNCA and Credit Lyonnnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE BANCAIRE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.20 PCT  MATURITY    16.MAY.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.052   PAY DATE    16.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70 PCT  REOFFER    99.752    SPREAD	+28 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	GOV LAW    FRENCH</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 2008 AND 2011 OATs -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
